# ⛔ This file is the ONLY env form git tracks. Everything else — `.env`,
# `.env.*`, and any editor leftover like `.env.local~` or `.env.local.swp` — is
# ignored, because on 2026-09-11 an editor left `mobile/.env.local~` beside the
# real key file and the pattern at the time did not match it. It was empty by
# luck. B56 cost this project an entire repository for that class.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The phone: copy to `mobile/.env.local`
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# ⚠️ The operator interface IS the phone. There is no dev server and no CLI —
# `src/cli`, `src/app` and `src/server` were deleted at 5.10.
#
# SoldComps is the fund's ONLY automated data route: eBay's developer account
# was denied outright and is not retryable (D16). The key starts `sc_`.
#
# ⚠️ Metered and paid. Each scored item costs 2 requests — `sold=false` for the
# competition, then `sold=true` pinned to the category that call declared — so
# the free 100/month is about 50 items. The app shows what is left, and an
# exhausted month degrades to typing rather than breaking the screen.
#
# ⛔ `EXPO_PUBLIC_` is not a secret store. Anything with that prefix is compiled
# into the bundle and is readable by anyone who has the app. That is acceptable
# for a single-operator private build and would not be for a published one.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SOLDCOMPS_KEY=
